"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">· </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">통계학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일-지원가능 전공 확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">대학 입학 당해 연도의 수능성적이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">개 영역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">영어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">탐구 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">모두 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">등급 이내인자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">탐구영역의 경우 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">과목의 등급 평균이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">등급 이내면 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3) 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 이수 학점을 총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학점 이상 신청한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"let