mily: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금 지급 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기당 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">개인별 장학금 지급액은 타 기관으로부터 받는 장학금을 포함하여 해당 학기의 학비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">입학금과 등록금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">를 초과하지 않는다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">연 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">회 학기 별로 지급하되</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지급 횟수는 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년으로 선발된 자는 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">를 초과하지 않는다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">생활지원금 지급 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">연간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">360</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">휴학생은 제외)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- 매월 30만원씩 분할지급하며 총 지급 횟수는 48개월분(2학년으로 선발된 자는 최대 36개월분)을 초과하지 않는다.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림,